# Static security headers for the lunarlog web build (epic #831, slice 1).
#
# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify-style `_headers`. Every rule below is part of the
# web security posture recorded in `docs/web/security-posture.md`; the
# non-negotiable directives are pinned by
# `test/architecture/web_headers_test.dart`, so this file and that test move
# together.
#
# Notes on the policy:
#   * `script-src 'self'` — Flutter's engine and `sqlite3.wasm` are bundled
#     into the build (built with `--no-web-resources-cdn`, so CanvasKit is
#     local too; no CDN scripts). `'wasm-unsafe-eval'` lets the engine
#     compile the bundled WASM without enabling general `eval`.
#   * `style-src 'unsafe-inline'` — the Flutter engine injects inline style for
#     its view; this is far narrower than an unsafe script source.
#   * `worker-src`/`child-src blob:` — `drift_worker.js` and the engine's
#     workers may be created from blob URLs.
#   * `font-src`/`connect-src` include `https://fonts.gstatic.com` so the
#     engine can fetch its Noto fallback fonts when text contains characters
#     the bundled Inter/Fraunces/Roboto faces lack (emoji, non-Latin names),
#     instead of drawing tofu. A plain boot uses the bundled faces and makes
#     no such request; a fallback fetch happens only when such a glyph is
#     drawn and carries no text content (issue #1091).
#   * `connect-src` — the app origin, the Supabase project (HTTPS for PostgREST
#     and WSS for Realtime), the Google Fonts fallback host above, and Sentry's
#     ingest host when crash reporting is configured. Nothing else.
#   * Cross-origin isolation (COOP/COEP) lets drift's WASM executor use
#     shared-memory modes; without them it safely falls back to IndexedDB
#     (`lib/data/db/web_db.dart`).
#   * `frame-ancestors 'none'` plus `X-Frame-Options: DENY` — this app is never
#     framed.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' blob: https://dleexnnevuuddcgcpztq.supabase.co wss://dleexnnevuuddcgcpztq.supabase.co https://fonts.gstatic.com https://*.ingest.sentry.io https://*.ingest.us.sentry.io; worker-src 'self' blob:; child-src 'self' blob:; manifest-src 'self'; frame-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), midi=(), payment=(), publickey-credentials-get=(), usb=(), xr-spatial-tracking=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
